    "title": "TutorMatching Hiring API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Planned contract. ISO weekly times in Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh; UTC events. Authentication and CSRF use the existing application middleware. No anonymous or admin access in Sprint 3."
  },
